{"version":1,"key":"card:553","content":{"id":553,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在为笔记软件的高亮添加背景时，为了显示出具有手写马克笔划线的高亮效果，使用了 CSS Houdini 技术来绘制背景","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5d92645d-bbc9-46ab-9635-e5e2d9c6440b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// marker-painter.ts\nclass MarkerPainter {\n  static get inputProperties() {\n    return [\n      \"--marker-color\",\n      \"--marker-offset\",\n      \"--marker-roughness\",\n    ];\n  }\n\n  paint(ctx, geom, props) {\n    // xxx\n  }\n}\n\nregisterPaint(\"marker-highlight\", MarkerPainter);","collabId":"67ca0029-e196-487c-809a-94df0fc9e09d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"1888d08d-a706-464a-bb07-c1c5a43487b8","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b1080a4f-2cf7-45b5-a3dc-6bf0a0a8c2a9"},{"children":[{"text":"在使用前需要使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"CSS.paintWorklet.addModule(moduleURL)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 进行注册，如方法参数签名所见，它接受一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"URL","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 而不是直接 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"import","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 得到的对象，根据 Vite 的文档，可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"?url","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 获得模块的路径，或者通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"?raw","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 获取到代码，然后创建 Blob URL","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"163b42fd-bd1a-422c-af7e-806ba6c4a5e4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import workletURL from \"./marker-painter.ts?url\";\nCSS.paintWorklet.addModule(workletURL);","collabId":"75a1cf6d-8125-46dd-b649-d88707ca85f3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"36cfa9d0-436e-4f10-810d-1d3788ce7c41","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e0c3fe2e-b910-4ef0-ab2a-502c1a2d52dc"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import workletCode from \"./marker-painter.ts?raw\";\nconst blob = new Blob([workletCode], { type: \"application/javascript\" });\nCSS.paintWorklet.addModule(URL.createObjectURL(blob));","collabId":"65c31262-949d-4723-9301-5f62d1fde613","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2e1ed04a-bdf7-4175-a2ac-af22b73b123f","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"034e142e-5c87-45a2-9285-905ac9a60f3d"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"?url","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 在开发模式下没问题，但是打包构建后就不行，经过一番排查，把 ts 文件改为 js 后就能正常工作了，Vite 有点坑，这种情况居然不转译😑。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cfac731e-6dae-4586-997d-c355f29d9334","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"?raw","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 如果导入的是 TypeScript 代码，在开发模式下就会报错，我是在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"?url","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 不行后尝试 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"?raw","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 才发现要把 ts 改为 js。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"305b2b73-c049-44db-a972-fdc03829ce3f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"22b18754-bbe8-43e8-a90b-123070e11be3","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"